&gt; Wyzer supports standard if&#x2F;else, while, and for loops. Note that loops don&#x27;t need parentheses around the condition.<p>But <i>why</i>!? You know what&#x27;d be cool? If we started supporting control statements that were a bit more sophisticated!<p>```
do
{
}
while (c)
{
  if (x) break foo;
}
else
{
case foo : ...;
default  : ...;
}
```
